flowchart TB
  JWT[Verified JWT] --> User[DB-resolved active user UUID]
  User --> SQL[Explicit SQL owner filters]
  User --> RLS[Transaction-local RLS context]
  User --> VectorFilter[Server-built Qdrant user_id filter]
  VectorFilter --> IDs[Untrusted candidate chunk IDs]
  IDs --> SQLRecheck[PostgreSQL owner + document + generation recheck]
  SQLRecheck --> Evidence[Only authorized text becomes evidence]
  Evidence --> Model[Optional LLM]
  Client[Client body] -. user_id is forbidden/ignored as identity .-> User
  Model -. cannot set identity or permissions .-> User
